    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Let's say, you know, this climate change, I never call it a thing, but for some people it's a thing. And I've asked you this before when you've joined us, make the climate change argument real, substantive, relevant for people. So it's not some abstract conversation where people are quoting the scientists who believes what they think they believe to try to prove a point which isn't productive.",
