        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Quoting scientists without contextualization undermines persuasive impact.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker values practical, actionable discourse over theoretical or academic debate.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener shares an expectation to present arguments in a way that connects emotionally or practically.",
