        "text": "The Clean Future Act serves as a response to climate change, functioning as a climate action plan.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Many people react dismissively when presented with extreme climate scenarios, such as the Statue of Liberty submerging or 100-foot waves hitting Manhattan.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Climate change impacts human health, particularly for individuals with asthma or respiratory conditions.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Rising sea levels are observable along the Jersey Shore.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Greenhouse gas emissions contribute to adverse effects on public health.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Framing climate change as a health and safety issue makes it more relatable than framing it as a catastrophe.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "text": "Audiences are more likely to engage with climate policy when it is framed around immediate personal risks rather than abstract future disasters.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
