        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Health impacts of climate change are credible and recognizable enough to serve as effective motivators for policy support.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "People prioritize their own well-being and that of their communities over distant or speculative environmental threats.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
