    "turn_text": "Got it. Now, let's talk about beyond climate change. latest poll, I believe a Pew poll, said that over 50 percent of Republican men say they will not take the COVID vaccine. And much of it is based on political ideology, a sense that this isn't science, and that somehow they don't need it. That, to me, and most other reasonable people, says that we're looking at the same set of facts and having very different interpretations, which causes a whole range of division, not to mention the problems relating to getting to herd immunity.",
